{"last_link_id": 29, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 总的来说。一个优质的音色创造提示词通常包含以下几个层次，组合得越多越详细，效果越好。\n##  1.基础声学属性:直接描述性别、音高(如低沉、高亢)、语速、音量、清晰度、口音等。\n##  2.情感与语气:指定情绪(如兴奋、悲伤、严肃)，以及语调(如命令式、疑问式、欢快)。\n##  3.人物画像:描述年龄、性格(如权威果断、撒娇點人)，甚至外貌、背景故事，这能极大地帮助模型把握声音的“神韵”。\n##  4.场景与质感:说明场景(如聊天、演讲、争吵)和声音的质感(如清脆、沙哑、带有鼻音、有气息声)。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [481.79498291015625, 346.9831848144531], "pos": [-3592.294189453125, -963.9080200195312], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [603.4358520507812, 323.1331481933594], "pos": [-1198.08203125, -913.1919555664062], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 21, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "model", "links": [20], "label": "model", "type": "VOXCPM_MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "size": [373.0041809082031, 115.65547180175781], "pos": [-1626.4366455078125, -942.6314086914062], "widgets_values": ["VoxCPM2", false, "None"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "optimize"}, "name": "optimize", "label": "optimize", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "optimize"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "shape": 7, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "RunningHub_VoxCPM_LoadModel", "